OL,3,GNEWSAMisogyny and intimidation claims
OL,4,Aat county council
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllegations have been made of misogyny
OL,7,Fand intimidation directed against
OL,8,Ffemale councillors at a local
OL,9,Fauthority.
OL,11,FThe claims were made at a meeting of
OL,12,FOxfordshire County Council, when former
OL,13,FLiberal Democrat councillor, Dr Lidia
OL,14,FArciszewska, spoke in support of a
OL,15,Fmotion around violence against women
OL,16,Fand girls.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
