OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMisogyny and intimidation claims
OL,4,Aat county council
OL,5,
OL,6,FArciszewska stopped short of publicly
OL,7,Fnaming anyone, but listed several times
OL,8,Fwhen she said female politicians had
OL,9,Fbeen verbally abused by councillors,
OL,10,F"some of whom sit in this very
OL,11,Fchamber," with no action being taken by
OL,12,Fthe council.
OL,14,FA spokesperson for Oxfordshire County
OL,15,FCouncil said they take all allegations
OL,16,Fof misogyny, sexism, bullying and abuse
OL,17,F"extremely seriously."
